#
# min hour dom mon dow command
#
# min 0-59, hour 0-23, dom 1-31, mon 1-12, dow 0-7 (0 and 7 are Sunday).
# Every field is either "*" or a single number. Lists, ranges and steps
# (1,15  1-5  */5) are not supported and cause the line to be rejected.
# If both dom and dow are set, both must match.
#
# The file must be owned by the user running mcron and must not be
# writable by group or others, otherwise mcron refuses to use it.
#
# Examples:
#
# 30 2 * * * /usr/local/bin/backup.sh
# 0 4 * * 1 /usr/local/bin/maintenance.sh
